# Pairs with RestoredCutNotReAdvanced. The drain stamps no admission epoch, so an
# entry parked before the restore paused receiving drains onto the restored copy
# once the lift opens it.
MODULE: RestoredCutNotReAdvancedDrainIgnoresEpoch
TARGET: RestoredCutNotReAdvanced
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the causal-buffer drain applies an entry parked before the restore
PERTURBS: Drain

--- FIND
    /\ IF q.ep < floor[d][alias[d]]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the parked epoch is ignored.
    /\ IF FALSE
--- END
